    "position": {
      "type": "fye-callout",
      "settings": {
        "band": "ivory",
        "style": "strong",
        "narrow": true,
        "eyebrow": "Our Position",
        "heading": "A Report Is Evidence, Not a Recommendation",
        "body": "<p>Two diamonds with identical reports can look quite different, and the paperwork will not tell you which is which. Light return, the shape of an outline, whether a bow tie shadow crosses the centre of an oval: none of it appears as a grade.</p><p>So we look at stones before we put them in front of you, and when a decision is close we will show you both and explain what we think and why. If you would rather see them yourself, we can arrange a face to face meeting.</p>"
